		"viz_taSlB1UT": {
			"options": {
				"markdown": "## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nproject/\n├── main_generate.sh              # Master orchestrator (auto-selects sources from scenario)\n├── shared/\n│   ├── config.sh                 # Global defaults, paths, colors\n│   ├── company.sh                # Organization data (users, servers, threat actor)\n│   ├── products.sh               # Product catalog (50 IT t-shirts)\n│   ├── customers.sh              # Customer pool (500 customers, international)\n│   ├── session_utils.sh          # Session/order ID generation, journeys\n│   ├── time_utils.sh             # Cross-platform timestamp functions\n│   └── output_utils.sh           # File handling, short_path(), DONE/FAIL status\n├── scenarios/\n│   ├── registry.sh               # Scenario definitions & helper functions\n│   ├── attack/\n│   │   ├── exfil.sh              # ASA events\n│   │   ├── exfil_entraid.sh      # Entra ID events (v2.2 - enhanced realism)\n│   │   ├── exfil_exchange.sh     # Exchange Message Trace events (NEW)\n│   │   ├── exfil_aws.sh          # AWS CloudTrail events\n│   │   ├── exfil_gcp.sh          # GCP Audit events\n│   │   ├── exfil_perfmon.sh      # Windows Perfmon anomalies\n│   │   ├── exfil_wineventlog.sh  # Windows Event Log events\n│   │   └── exfil_linux.sh        # Linux metric anomalies\n│   ├── ops/\n│   │   ├── memory_leak_linux.sh  # Linux metrics for WEB-01\n│   │   ├── memory_leak_asa.sh    # ASA timeout/reset events\n│   │   ├── cpu_runaway_perfmon.sh    # SQL-PROD-01 CPU/Memory metrics\n│   │   ├── cpu_runaway_wineventlog.sh # SQL Server events (833, 17883, 3041)\n│   │   ├── cpu_runaway_access.sh     # Response time degradation\n│   │   └── cpu_runaway_asa.sh        # Connection timeouts/resets\n│   └── network/\n│       └── firewall_misconfig_asa.sh  # Firewall misconfiguration\n├── baseline/\n│   ├── baseline_asa.sh           # Cisco ASA baseline\n│   ├── baseline_entraid.sh       # Entra ID baseline\n│   ├── baseline_exchange.sh      # Exchange Message Trace baseline (NEW)\n│   ├── baseline_aws.sh           # AWS CloudTrail baseline\n│   ├── baseline_gcp.sh           # GCP Audit baseline\n│   ├── baseline_perfmon.sh       # Windows Perfmon baseline\n│   ├── baseline_wineventlog.sh   # Windows Event Log baseline\n│   ├── baseline_linux.sh         # Linux metrics baseline\n│   └── baseline_access.sh        # Web access logs baseline\n├── generators/\n│   ├── generate_asa.sh           # Cisco ASA generator\n│   ├── generate_entraid.sh       # Entra ID generator\n│   ├── generate_exchange.sh      # Exchange Message Trace generator (NEW)\n│   ├── generate_aws.sh           # AWS CloudTrail generator\n│   ├── generate_gcp.sh           # GCP Audit generator\n│   ├── generate_perfmon.sh       # Windows Perfmon generator\n│   ├── generate_wineventlog.sh   # Windows Event Log generator\n│   ├── generate_linux.sh         # Linux metrics generator\n│   ├── generate_access.sh        # Web access logs → creates order_registry.json\n│   ├── generate_servicebus.sh    # Azure Service Bus events (reads registry)\n│   ├── generate_orders.sh        # Retail order records (reads registry)\n│   └── generate_customer_lookup.sh  # Customer lookup CSV generator\n├── splunk/\n│   └── lookups/\n│       └── customer_lookup.csv   # Customer name lookup for Splunk\n└── output/\n    ├── network/\n    │   └── cisco_asa.log\n    ├── cloud/\n    │   ├── entraid_signin.json\n    │   ├── entraid_audit.json\n    │   ├── aws_cloudtrail.json\n    │   ├── gcp_audit.json\n    │   └── exchange_message_trace.json  # NEW\n    ├── windows/\n    │   ├── perfmon_processor.log\n    │   ├── perfmon_memory.log\n    │   ├── perfmon_logicaldisk.log\n    │   ├── wineventlog_security.log\n    │   ├── wineventlog_system.log\n    │   └── wineventlog_application.log  # SQL Server events (cpu_runaway)\n    ├── linux/\n    │   ├── cpu.log\n    │   ├── vmstat.log\n    │   ├── df.log\n    │   ├── iostat.log\n    │   └── interfaces.log\n    ├── web/\n    │   ├── access_combined.log\n    │   ├── order_registry.json   # Intermediate file for correlation\n    │   └── .order_sequence       # Order ID sequence (hidden, per-run)\n    ├── servicebus/\n    │   └── servicebus_events.json\n    └── retail/\n        └── orders.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Data Sources\n\n### Implementation Status\n\n| Source | Baseline | Generator | Scenarios | Status |\n|--------|----------|-----------|-----------|--------|\n| Cisco ASA | ✅ | ✅ | exfil, memory_leak, firewall_misconfig, cpu_runaway | **Complete** |\n| Entra ID | ✅ | ✅ | exfil | **Complete** |\n| Exchange Online | ✅ | ✅ | exfil | **Complete** ⭐ NEW |\n| AWS CloudTrail | ✅ | ✅ | exfil | **Complete** |\n| GCP Audit | ✅ | ✅ | exfil | **Complete** |\n| Windows Perfmon | ✅ | ✅ | exfil, cpu_runaway | **Complete** |\n| Windows Event Log | ✅ | ✅ | exfil, cpu_runaway | **Complete** |\n| Linux Metrics | ✅ | ✅ | exfil, memory_leak | **Complete** |\n| Web Access Logs | ✅ | ✅ | memory_leak, firewall_misconfig, cpu_runaway | **Complete** ⭐ |\n| Azure Service Bus | N/A | ✅ | (inherits from access) | **Complete** ⭐ |\n| Retail Orders | N/A | ✅ | (inherits from access) | **Complete** ⭐ |"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
